<view class="recommend-page data-v-ade9e21a"><view class="page-header data-v-ade9e21a"><view class="header-content data-v-ade9e21a"><view class="title-section data-v-ade9e21a"><text class="title-icon data-v-ade9e21a">⭐</text><text class="page-title data-v-ade9e21a">AI智能推荐</text></view><text class="header-tag data-v-ade9e21a">个性化推荐</text></view><view class="header-desc data-v-ade9e21a">基于您的浏览偏好，为您推荐合适的房源</view></view><view class="refresh-section data-v-ade9e21a"><button class="{{['refresh-btn', 'data-v-ade9e21a', b && 'loading']}}" bindtap="{{c}}"><text class="refresh-icon data-v-ade9e21a">🔄</text><text class="data-v-ade9e21a">{{a}}</text></button></view><view class="recommend-content data-v-ade9e21a"><view wx:if="{{d}}" class="loading-container data-v-ade9e21a"><text class="loading-icon data-v-ade9e21a">⏳</text><text class="loading-text data-v-ade9e21a">AI正在为您推荐房源...</text></view><view wx:elif="{{e}}" class="empty-container data-v-ade9e21a"><text class="empty-icon data-v-ade9e21a">📋</text><text class="empty-text data-v-ade9e21a">暂无推荐房源</text><view class="empty-tip data-v-ade9e21a"><text class="data-v-ade9e21a">浏览更多房源后，AI将为您推荐更合适的房源</text><button class="browse-btn data-v-ade9e21a" bindtap="{{f}}"> 去浏览房源 </button></view></view><view wx:else class="property-list data-v-ade9e21a"><view wx:for="{{g}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="n" class="property-card data-v-ade9e21a" bindtap="{{item.o}}"><view class="property-image data-v-ade9e21a"><image src="{{item.a}}" mode="aspectFill" class="image data-v-ade9e21a"></image><view class="recommend-badge data-v-ade9e21a"><text class="badge-icon data-v-ade9e21a">⭐</text><text class="data-v-ade9e21a">AI推荐</text></view><view class="recommend-score data-v-ade9e21a"><text class="score-icon data-v-ade9e21a">👍</text><text class="data-v-ade9e21a">{{item.b}}分</text></view></view><view class="property-info data-v-ade9e21a"><view class="property-title data-v-ade9e21a">{{item.c}}</view><view class="property-price data-v-ade9e21a"><text class="pric